values ('f0a1b2c3-4d5e-4f00-9a90-0b1c2d3e4f10', 'world-history-i', 'World History I', 'This foundational undergraduate History course surveys premodern global history from human origins and early civilizations through cross-cultural networks and transformations around 1500. It provides a world history core while expanding the syllabus with stronger historical method, source analysis, regional balance, environmental context, material culture, trade networks, religions, and a small research capstone.');

